    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 10,
    "title": "Describe an action in progress",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-progressive-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Describe an action in progress",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put 在, 正在 or 正 before an action to present it as ongoing at the reference time. Continuing-situation 呢 may appear at the end. In an action frame 在 differs from 在 followed by a location to say where an entity is.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "爸爸在看书呢。",
                "pinyin": "bàba zài kàn shū ne 。",
                "meaning": "Dad is reading.",
                "audio": "b94c089099bc43201fb3da6ad227ea1cab6d0ac865630afb4399bee1100335d2"
              },
              {
                "text": "妈妈正在听歌。",
                "pinyin": "māma zhèngzài tīng gē 。",
                "meaning": "Mom is listening to songs.",
                "audio": "bbfa7e5aa9d9907387a40b8db657fabbf80d854bd377e1059cd194921133e414"
              },
              {
                "text": "我正看书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zhèng kàn shū 。",
                "meaning": "I am reading right now.",
                "audio": "43c252b91b1f0c42504ed7178b0d884d258fcb1d85ef8efafe8951c8f7557afb"
              },
              {
                "text": "爸爸在家。",
